 "notes": [
  "Calendar: The Events Calendar (WordPress) at texasadventist.org/events with a public REST API; 51 entries, all between Apr 4 and Dec 12, 2026. Entries before April 2026 were removed with the March 2026 site rebuild and the Internet Archive was offline during this research, so Oct 2025 - Mar 2026 relies on conference pages (convocations, Catalyst summit) and Southwestern Union Record stories. Calendar entries have categories (Youth, Club Ministries, Women's Ministries, Prayer, Spanish Evangelism, etc.) but rarely a place or description.",
  "English and Spanish versions of the same event (10 Days of Prayer each quarter; women's ministries events at each convocation) are merged into one entry each. The youth website (youngtexasadventist.org/events) shows no events.",
  "2026 is built around 'Together As One': seven regional weekend convocations (McAllen, Tyler, San Antonio, Houston, Dallas, Austin, Keene) that combine worship with English and Spanish local-church officer training - 'mini camp meetings' in the president's words - then the first Texas camp meeting in over a decade (Camp Meeting Sabbath Nov 14, 2026, Lake Whitney Ranch 20th anniversary weekend Nov 13-15).",
  "Evangelism shows up as concrete events: The Great Controversy mass distribution (Apr 25, 2026: 115 churches, 111,243 copies planned; nearly 200,000 reported distributed), the Amazing Facts 'Amazing Disciples' soul-winning workshop (Sep 24-27, 2026), MAS Evangelismo East Texas (Spanish, Oct 24-31, 2026), CONECTADOS virtual Spanish evangelism (Dec 6-11, 2026), Catalyst church-planting and revitalization summits in each area (English and Spanish). The Hispanic ministries page names four yearly events per area (metropolitan evangelism 'MAS esperanza', evangelism training, elders' meetings, church-officer training) but gives no dates.",
  "Youth and club ministry is the largest block on the calendar (Lake Whitney Ranch hosts camporees, Adventurer family camp - 2,500+ attended Apr 2026 - TLT, drill and drum, summer camps and the union Pathfinder camporee).",
  "Local-church events from the Record are kept with level 'church' (Messiah's Mansion sanctuary exhibit in Victoria, Keene winter-storm relief, Garland free dental clinic, Living Springs community guest day).",
  "Pastoral ordination: the calendar says Nov 14, 2026, the announcements page Nov 7, 2026 (calendar date used)."
 ]
